              for the induced field coordinates.
            %p
              Accordingly, the shifted infinitesimal
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vertical+cotangent+bundle"} vertical cotangent bundle
              (def.
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#InfinitesimalCotangentBundleOfFieldAndGaugeParameterBundle"}
