          %p#GaugeFixingExamples
            %strong Gauge fixed electromagnetic field
          %p
            As an example of the general theory of BV-BRST
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+fixing"} gauge fixing
            above we now discuss the gauge fixing of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/electromagnetic+field"} electromagnetic field
          #NLGaugeFixingOfElectromagnetism.num_example
            %h6#example_2 Example
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gaussian-averaged+Lorenz+gauge"} Gaussian-averaged Lorenz gauge
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+fixing"} fixing
                of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vacuum"} vacuum
                = succeed ")" do
