            %p
              Consider the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+BV-BRST+complex"} local BV-BRST complex
              for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+field+theory"} free
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/electromagnetic+field"} electromagnetic field
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Minkowski+spacetime"} Minkowski spacetime
              from example
